
Played 4 careers to a season rollover.
1) Every club in the field has a reason to be there
   128 places across 4 fields, every one traced to a finish or the holders' route
2) The club that just missed is really out
   60 league cuts, 56 clubs one place short and correctly absent
3) A full eight group draw, nobody twice
   4 fields of 32, no duplicates
4) My group opponents come out of the field and avoid my own league
   2 groups, every opponent a real qualifier from another league
5) A historic era still falls back to the pool
   2015-16 still draws from its pool, and Real Madrid still start season one in Europe
6) The knockout draws from the field too, not from the pool
   Real Madrid's second season: 8 clubs across the draw and bracket, all qualifiers
7) A half played season yields no field at all
   mid season yields nothing, the finished season it came from still yields 32

